ca Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">谷歌 Gemini Omni Flash 登顶 Video Arena 视频模型盲测榜首</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">英伟达开源 Nemotron-Labs-TwoTower 模型，文本生成速度提升 2.42 倍</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">微软曝光AI PC专属系统Project Aion，彻底取消传统开始菜单</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿里达摩院联合高校发布超导材料AI智能体Elements Claw</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/14aa4a3aaa794242e2faf9f891550eec.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">7月3日，阿里达摩院联合中国人民大学、中国科学院大学发布全球首个超导材料发现AI智能体Elements Claw。该智能体采用“专通融合”架构，基于1.25亿分子与晶体结构数据库训练，并构建了10亿参数的原子基础模型Elements。其超导潜力判断AUC指标达0.996，临界温度预测误差控制在1K以内。在测试中，Elements Claw仅耗费28个GPU小时，即从240万个晶体结构中筛选出6.8万个候选材料，并成功合成验证了HfZrRe4、Hf21Re25、Zr4VRe7和Zr3ScRe8等4种新材料，最高临界温度达6.5K。该智能体具备自主查阅文献、评估合成可行性及实验设计等全流程作业能力。目前，研究团队已向行业全量开放240万个稳定晶体数据，未来该框架有望复用于固态电池电解质、多相催化剂及热电材料等领域，</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿里巴巴下发内部指令全面禁用 Claude 系列 AI 模型及工具</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/662819d99f5688f33080926fcfad78c3.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">阿里巴巴已下发内部指令，要求全体员工在7月10日前停止使用 Anthropic 旗下的 Claude 系列产品，包括 Sonnet、Opus、Fable 模型及 Claude Code 智能体工具。此前阿里曾推行开放策略，为员工提供外部模型报销方案，但近期开发者披露 Claude Code 内置隐蔽检测机制，通过代码注入实时监测用户设备时区及域名访问情况，并向 Anthropic 上报交互数据，触及企业研发安全红线。Anthropic 回应称该机制为3月上线的实验性功能，旨在防范滥用与模型蒸馏，并已在7月2日的最新版本中回滚删除。此次禁令反映出国内科技巨头在追求生产力提升与捍卫核心代码产权、规避数据回流风险之间的博弈，标志着企业内部 AI 开发流程的合规管控进入硬核阶段。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌 Gemini Omni Flash 登顶 Video Arena 视频模型盲测榜首</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/94403fe671c89a7cd9281f2b8b8205b1.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">7月3日，权威视频模型盲测排行榜 Video Arena 正式更新，谷歌 DeepMind 推出的文生视频模型 Gemini Omni Flash 以 1404 Elo 的高分跃居榜首。此次排名变动标志着谷歌在多模态大模型领域的显著突破，其视频模型整体排名较 Veo 时期提升了 7 位。Gemini Omni Flash 目前领先此前长期占据榜首的字节跳动 Seedance 系列模型 101 Elo 分值。Video Arena 的排名基于用户真实盲测投票，涵盖生成质量、逻辑一致性及用户体验等维度。此次登顶反映了在算力支撑与模型架构优化驱动下，视频生成技术迭代速度加快，行业天花板被持续拉高。对于开发者与行业而言，这一竞争格局的重塑预示着高质量视频内容创作的技术底座正在夯实，后续市场将密切关注各头部厂商在模型版本</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">英伟达开源 Nemotron-Labs-TwoTower 模型，文本生成速度提升 2.42 倍</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/0165e5d54c3622a31a061347b63f7e7b.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">英伟达于 7 月 2 日正式开源 Nemotron-Labs-TwoTower 离散扩散语言模型，旨在解决大模型串行生成 Token 速度慢的瓶颈。该模型采用 60B 双塔架构，将模型拆分为两座 30B 独立神经网络，每塔激活 3B 参数并搭载 128 个可路由专家模块。其中，上下文塔负责留存语义，去噪塔利用扩散机制并行生成文本，两塔通过交叉注意力机制协同。基准测试显示，该模型在保持原版 98.7% 综合能力的同时，文本生成吞吐速度提升 2.42 倍。开发者可在 Huggingface 下载权重，部署需搭配双张 H100 或 A100 80GB 显卡协同运行。该架构复用了 Nemotron 骨干网络预训练权重，无需从零训练，显著降低了开发成本，适用于对推理速度有高要求的生产环境。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">微软曝光AI PC专属系统Project Aion，彻底取消传统开始菜单</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/f04eb1fa995ceb472bf560be4f035384.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">微软内部代号Project Aion的全新AI操作系统正式曝光，该系统专为AI PC打造，彻底摒弃了传统Windows的开始菜单与桌面图标。Project Aion基于Edge浏览器与网页轻量化技术构建，交互逻辑完全重构，底部任务栏集成Copilot作为核心操作入口。系统以Web应用为核心生态，不再支持Windows原生桌面软件，若需运行传统软件，用户需通过Windows 365远程桌面服务进行云端适配。该系统独创“空间”功能，可自动归类网页与应用以提升多任务处理效率，核心围绕信息流、内容创作及实时资讯打造。Project Aion代表了微软在AI时代对PC人机交互模式的深度重构，标志着其系统研发方向正向轻量化、AI驱动的云端生态转型。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
